# 2.1
('<h2><span class="num">2.1</span>致動盤：推力就是動量的增加</h2>', '<h2><span class="num">2.1</span>The actuator disc: thrust is added momentum</h2>'),
('<p>先把螺旋槳想成一片很薄、會讓水壓突然升高的圓盤，不管葉片的形狀。穿過圓盤的水被加速，流管往下游收縮。對流管用動量守恆與白努利方程，可以得到圓盤處的速度增量正好是遠方尾流增量的一半：</p>',
 '<p>First think of the propeller as a very thin disc that raises the water pressure abruptly, and forget the blade shape. Water passing through is accelerated and the stream tube contracts downstream. Momentum conservation and Bernoulli\'s equation show that the velocity increase at the disc is exactly half that in the far wake:</p>'),
('V<sub>A</sub>(1 + a)，V<sub>wake</sub>', 'V<sub>A</sub>(1 + a), V<sub>wake</sub>'),
('<p>有用功率是 <span class="m">T V<sub>A</sub></span>，槳交給水的功率是 <span class="m">T V<sub>A</sub>(1 + a)</span>，所以理想效率</p>',
 '<p>The useful power is <span class="m">T V<sub>A</sub></span> and the power delivered to the water is <span class="m">T V<sub>A</sub>(1 + a)</span>, so the ideal efficiency is</p>'),
('<p>這是任何推進器都超越不了的上限，損失的部分是留在尾流裡的動能。負載越重（<span class="m">C<sub>T</sub></span> 越大），要把水加速得越多，效率越低。要降低 <span class="m">C<sub>T</sub></span>，最直接的辦法是加大直徑：同樣的推力分給更多的水。</p>',
 '<p>No propulsor can beat this limit; the loss is the kinetic energy left in the wake. The heavier the loading (the larger <span class="m">C<sub>T</sub></span>), the more the water must be accelerated and the lower the efficiency. The most direct way to reduce <span class="m">C<sub>T</sub></span> is a larger diameter: the same thrust shared by more water.</p>'),
('<p class="note">致動盤假設流體無黏、推力均勻分布在盤面上、尾流不旋轉。下一節的葉素理論會把旋轉和黏性損失加回來。</p>',
 '<p class="note">The actuator disc assumes inviscid flow, uniform thrust over the disc and no wake rotation. Blade-element theory in the next section adds back the rotational and viscous losses.</p>'),
('<span>推力負載係數 C<sub>T</sub></span>', '<span>Thrust loading coefficient C<sub>T</sub></span>'),
('<span class="lab">負載</span>', '<span class="lab">Loading</span>'),
