# 2.2
('<h2><span class="num">2.2</span>速度三角形：一個剖面看到什麼</h2>', '<h2><span class="num">2.2</span>The velocity triangle: what a section sees</h2>'),
('<p>回到葉片本身。在半徑 <span class="m">r</span> 的剖面上，水從前方以 <span class="m">V<sub>A</sub></span> 流來，剖面本身以 <span class="m">ωr</span> 轉動。兩者合成的角度叫進角 <span class="m">β</span>：</p>',
 '<p>Back to the blade itself. At the section of radius <span class="m">r</span>, water arrives from ahead at <span class="m">V<sub>A</sub></span> while the section moves at <span class="m">ωr</span>. The angle of the combined velocity is the advance angle <span class="m">β</span>:</p>'),
('<p>槳在推水，水也反過來被槳帶動：軸向多了 <span class="m">a V<sub>A</sub></span>，切向被帶著轉了 <span class="m">a′ωr</span>。剖面真正看到的相對速度 <span class="m">W</span> 方向是誘導進角 <span class="m">β<sub>i</sub></span>，攻角是螺距角減去它：<span class="m">α = φ − β<sub>i</sub></span>。</p>',
 '<p>The propeller pushes the water, and the water is dragged along in return: an extra <span class="m">a V<sub>A</sub></span> axially and a swirl <span class="m">a′ωr</span> tangentially. The relative velocity <span class="m">W</span> that the section actually sees points along the hydrodynamic pitch angle <span class="m">β<sub>i</sub></span>, and the angle of attack is the pitch angle minus it: <span class="m">α = φ − β<sub>i</sub></span>.</p>'),
('<p>升力 <span class="m">dL</span> 垂直於 <span class="m">W</span>，阻力 <span class="m">dD</span> 沿著 <span class="m">W</span>，投影到軸向和切向就是推力與扭矩：</p>',
 '<p>Lift <span class="m">dL</span> is normal to <span class="m">W</span> and drag <span class="m">dD</span> lies along it; projected axially and tangentially they give thrust and torque:</p>'),
('<p>把這個剖面的效率 <span class="m">dT V<sub>A</sub> / (dQ ω)</span> 整理一下，正好拆成三個因子：軸向損失 <span class="m">1/(1 + a)</span>（就是致動盤的那一項）、尾流旋轉損失 <span class="m">1 − a′</span>，以及黏性損失 <span class="m">tan β<sub>i</sub> / tan(β<sub>i</sub> + γ)</span>，其中 <span class="m">tan γ = C<sub>D</sub>/C<sub>L</sub></span>。</p>',
 '<p>Rearranging the section efficiency <span class="m">dT V<sub>A</sub> / (dQ ω)</span> splits it into three factors: the axial loss <span class="m">1/(1 + a)</span> (the actuator-disc term), the wake-swirl loss <span class="m">1 − a′</span>, and the viscous loss <span class="m">tan β<sub>i</sub> / tan(β<sub>i</sub> + γ)</span> with <span class="m">tan γ = C<sub>D</sub>/C<sub>L</sub></span>.</p>'),
('<p class="note">本節的 <span class="m">a</span>、<span class="m">a′</span> 是 DTMB 4119 用下一節的葉素–動量理論解出來的值。</p>',
 '<p class="note">The <span class="m">a</span> and <span class="m">a′</span> here are those of DTMB 4119, solved with the blade-element momentum theory of the next section.</p>'),
('<span>剖面半徑 r/R</span>', '<span>Section radius r/R</span>'),
('<span>進速比 J</span>', '<span>Advance ratio J</span>'),
('<span>剖面阻力係數 C<sub>D</sub></span>', '<span>Section drag coefficient C<sub>D</sub></span>'),
('aria-label="葉剖面的速度三角形"', 'aria-label="Velocity triangle of a blade section"'),
('<figcaption>速度三角形。灰線是不計誘導速度的 <span class="m">V<sub>A</sub></span> 與 <span class="m">ωr</span>，紫線是誘導速度 <span class="m">a V<sub>A</sub></span>、<span class="m">a′ωr</span>，綠線是剖面看到的 <span class="m">W</span>。銅色虛線是剖面的弦線（螺距角 <span class="m">φ</span>）。</figcaption>',
 '<figcaption>The velocity triangle. Grey: <span class="m">V<sub>A</sub></span> and <span class="m">ωr</span> without induction; purple: the induced velocities <span class="m">a V<sub>A</sub></span> and <span class="m">a′ωr</span>; green: the <span class="m">W</span> the section sees. The dashed bronze line is the section chord (pitch angle <span class="m">φ</span>).</figcaption>'),
('aria-label="升力、阻力與推力、切向力"', 'aria-label="Lift and drag, thrust and tangential force"'),
('<figcaption>剖面上的力。升力（綠）垂直於 <span class="m">W</span>，阻力（橘）沿著 <span class="m">W</span>；兩者合成後投影成推力 <span class="m">dT</span>（往上游）與阻礙旋轉的切向力 <span class="m">dQ/r</span>。阻力已放大 5 倍以便看見。</figcaption>',
 '<figcaption>Forces on the section. Lift (green) is normal to <span class="m">W</span>, drag (orange) lies along it; their resultant projects into thrust <span class="m">dT</span> (upstream) and the tangential force <span class="m">dQ/r</span> resisting rotation. Drag is drawn five times larger so it can be seen.</figcaption>'),
('aria-label="剖面效率的三個因子"', 'aria-label="The three factors of section efficiency"'),
('<figcaption>這個剖面的效率拆成三個因子，乘起來就是最右邊的剖面效率。</figcaption>',
 '<figcaption>The section efficiency split into three factors; their product is the section efficiency on the right.</figcaption>'),
('"W 方向"', '"W direction"'),
('"這個半徑的攻角太小，升力 ≤ 0"', '"angle of attack too small here: lift ≤ 0"'),
('[["軸向", ea, "var(--flow)"], ["旋轉", et, "var(--pole)"], ["黏性", ev, "var(--pos)"], ["剖面", ea*et*ev, "var(--bronze)"]]',
 '[["axial", ea, "var(--flow)"], ["swirl", et, "var(--pole)"], ["viscous", ev, "var(--pos)"], ["section", ea*et*ev, "var(--bronze)"]]'),
('`<div>進角 <strong>β = ${f2(deg(e.beta))}°</strong>，誘導進角 <strong>β<sub>i</sub> = ${f2(deg(e.bi))}°</strong>，螺距角 <strong>φ = ${f2(deg(e.phi))}°</strong></div>',
 '`<div>Advance angle <strong>β = ${f2(deg(e.beta))}°</strong>, hydrodynamic pitch angle <strong>β<sub>i</sub> = ${f2(deg(e.bi))}°</strong>, pitch angle <strong>φ = ${f2(deg(e.phi))}°</strong></div>'),
('<div>攻角 <strong>α = ${f2(deg(e.alpha))}°</strong>（零升力角 ${f2(deg(ALPHA0*fC(x)/YMAX))}°），<strong>C<sub>L</sub> = ${f3(CL)}</strong></div>',
 '<div>Angle of attack <strong>α = ${f2(deg(e.alpha))}°</strong> (zero-lift angle ${f2(deg(ALPHA0*fC(x)/YMAX))}°), <strong>C<sub>L</sub> = ${f3(CL)}</strong></div>'),
('<div>誘導因子 <strong>a = ${f3(e.a)}</strong>，<strong>a′ = ${f3(e.ap)}</strong>；葉尖修正 <strong>F = ${f3(e.F)}</strong></div>',
 '<div>Induction factors <strong>a = ${f3(e.a)}</strong>, <strong>a′ = ${f3(e.ap)}</strong>; tip factor <strong>F = ${f3(e.F)}</strong></div>'),
('<div>剖面效率 <strong>${f3(ea*et*ev)}</strong> ＝ ${f3(ea)} × ${f3(et)} × ${f3(ev)}</div>`;',
 '<div>Section efficiency <strong>${f3(ea*et*ev)}</strong> = ${f3(ea)} × ${f3(et)} × ${f3(ev)}</div>`;'),

# 2.3
('<h2><span class="num">2.3</span>葉素–動量理論：把整支槳積分起來</h2>', '<h2><span class="num">2.3</span>Blade-element momentum theory: integrating the whole propeller</h2>'),
('<p>前一節的 <span class="m">a</span> 和 <span class="m">a′</span> 要怎麼求？把槳盤切成一圈一圈的環，每個環同時滿足兩件事：葉剖面算出來的力（上一節），要等於這個環的動量變化（2.1 的致動盤，只是換成一個環）：</p>',
 '<p>How are <span class="m">a</span> and <span class="m">a′</span> found? Cut the disc into annuli. In each one, the force from the blade sections (previous section) must equal the momentum change through that annulus (the actuator disc of 2.1, applied to a ring):</p>'),
('<p>兩組式子各自有 <span class="m">a</span>、<span class="m">a′</span>，反覆代入直到收斂。<span class="m">F</span> 是 Prandtl 葉尖修正：葉數有限，水會從葉尖繞過去，越靠近葉尖，動量理論高估得越多。</p>',
 '<p>Both sets contain <span class="m">a</span> and <span class="m">a′</span>; substitute back and forth until they converge. <span class="m">F</span> is the Prandtl tip factor: with a finite number of blades water leaks round the tips, so momentum theory overestimates more and more towards the tip.</p>'),
('<p>積分後用無因次係數表示：</p>', '<p>After integration the results are expressed as non-dimensional coefficients:</p>'),
('(ρn²D⁴)，K<sub>Q</sub>', '(ρn²D⁴), K<sub>Q</sub>'),
('<p>和 DTMB 4119 的試驗比較：在設計點 <span class="m">J</span> = 0.833，效率算得很準（0.70 對 0.69），但 <span class="m">K<sub>T</sub></span> 和 <span class="m">K<sub>Q</sub></span> 都高估了四成多。原因是剖面用了二維翼型的升力：寬葉片上的流線是彎的，實際的有效拱度和攻角都比較小。第三篇的升力線理論會處理這件事。</p>',
 '<p>Against the DTMB 4119 tests at the design point <span class="m">J</span> = 0.833, the efficiency comes out very close (0.70 against 0.69), but <span class="m">K<sub>T</sub></span> and <span class="m">K<sub>Q</sub></span> are both over-predicted by more than 40%. The cause is two-dimensional section lift: on wide blades the streamlines are curved, so the effective camber and angle of attack are smaller. Part 3 on lifting-line theory deals with this.</p>'),
('<p class="note">剖面升力用薄翼理論 <span class="m">C<sub>L</sub> = 2π(α − α<sub>0</sub>)</span>，零升力角 <span class="m">α<sub>0</sub></span> 由 <span class="m">a</span> = 0.8 平均線積分而得（<span class="m">C<sub>Li</sub></span> = 1 時為 −7.58°），再乘上各半徑的 <span class="m">C<sub>Li</sub></span>；阻力係數沿半徑取定值。</p>',
 '<p class="note">Section lift uses thin-airfoil theory, <span class="m">C<sub>L</sub> = 2π(α − α<sub>0</sub>)</span>; the zero-lift angle <span class="m">α<sub>0</sub></span> is integrated from the <span class="m">a</span> = 0.8 mean line (−7.58° at <span class="m">C<sub>Li</sub></span> = 1) and scaled by the local <span class="m">C<sub>Li</sub></span>. The drag coefficient is constant over the radius.</p>'),
('<button id="tip3" aria-pressed="true">Prandtl 葉尖修正</button>', '<button id="tip3" aria-pressed="true">Prandtl tip factor</button>'),
('aria-label="推力與扭矩的徑向分布"', 'aria-label="Radial distribution of thrust and torque"'),
('<figcaption>推力（銅色）與扭矩（藍色，×10）沿半徑的分布，曲線下的面積就是 <span class="m">K<sub>T</sub></span>、<span class="m">10K<sub>Q</sub></span>。虛線是不加葉尖修正的結果。</figcaption>',
 '<figcaption>Thrust (bronze) and torque (blue, ×10) along the radius; the areas under the curves are <span class="m">K<sub>T</sub></span> and <span class="m">10K<sub>Q</sub></span>. Dashed: without the tip factor.</figcaption>'),
('aria-label="誘導因子沿半徑的分布"', 'aria-label="Induction factors along the radius"'),
('<figcaption>軸向誘導因子 <span class="m">a</span>（紫）、切向誘導因子 <span class="m">a′</span>（紫虛線）與葉尖修正係數 <span class="m">F</span>（灰）。</figcaption>',
 '<figcaption>Axial induction factor <span class="m">a</span> (purple), tangential induction factor <span class="m">a′</span> (dashed purple) and the tip factor <span class="m">F</span> (grey).</figcaption>'),
('aria-label="DTMB 4119 的敞水曲線"', 'aria-label="Open-water curves of DTMB 4119"'),
('<figcaption>葉素–動量理論算出的 DTMB 4119 敞水曲線（線），與設計點的試驗值（圓圈，Jessup 1989）。直線標出目前的 <span class="m">J</span>。</figcaption>',
 '<figcaption>Open-water curves of DTMB 4119 from blade-element momentum theory (lines) and the measured design point (circles, Jessup 1989). The vertical line marks the current <span class="m">J</span>.</figcaption>'),
("/dx、10 dK", "/dx, 10 dK"),
('"試驗"', '"test"'),
('`<div>J = ${J.toFixed(2)}：<strong>K<sub>T</sub> = ${f3(R.KT)}</strong>，<strong>10K<sub>Q</sub> = ${f3(10*R.KQ)}</strong>，<strong>η<sub>0</sub> =',
 '`<div>J = ${J.toFixed(2)}: <strong>K<sub>T</sub> = ${f3(R.KT)}</strong>, <strong>10K<sub>Q</sub> = ${f3(10*R.KQ)}</strong>, <strong>η<sub>0</sub> ='),
('<div>設計點 J = 0.833：K<sub>T</sub> <strong>${f3(D.KT)}</strong>（試驗 0.146，<strong>', '<div>Design point J = 0.833: K<sub>T</sub> <strong>${f3(D.KT)}</strong> (test 0.146, <strong>'),
('%</strong>），η<sub>0</sub> <strong>${f3(D.eta)}</strong>（試驗 ${f3(etaExp)}）</div>`;', '%</strong>), η<sub>0</sub> <strong>${f3(D.eta)}</strong> (test ${f3(etaExp)})</div>`;'),

# 2.4
('<h2><span class="num">2.4</span>敞水曲線與 B 系列：用圖表選槳</h2>', '<h2><span class="num">2.4</span>Open-water curves and the B-series: choosing a propeller from charts</h2>'),
('<p>敞水曲線是槳在均勻來流中的「身分證」：橫軸 <span class="m">J</span>，縱軸 <span class="m">K<sub>T</sub></span>、<span class="m">10K<sub>Q</sub></span> 和 <span class="m">η<sub>0</sub></span>。<span class="m">J</span> 小代表重負載（推力大、效率低），<span class="m">J</span> 接近 <span class="m">P/D</span> 時推力趨近於零。</p>',
 '<p>The open-water curves are a propeller\'s identity card in uniform inflow: <span class="m">J</span> horizontally, <span class="m">K<sub>T</sub></span>, <span class="m">10K<sub>Q</sub></span> and <span class="m">η<sub>0</sub></span> vertically. Small <span class="m">J</span> means heavy loading (high thrust, low efficiency); as <span class="m">J</span> approaches <span class="m">P/D</span> the thrust falls towards zero.</p>'),
('<p>Wageningen B 系列是荷蘭 MARIN 系統化試驗的一百多支模型槳。Oosterveld 與 van Oossanen（1975）把結果迴歸成多項式，<span class="m">K<sub>T</sub></span> 有 39 項、<span class="m">K<sub>Q</sub></span> 有 47 項：</p>',
 '<p>The Wageningen B-series is a systematic set of more than a hundred model propellers tested at MARIN in the Netherlands. Oosterveld and van Oossanen (1975) fitted the results with polynomials, 39 terms for <span class="m">K<sub>T</sub></span> and 47 for <span class="m">K<sub>Q</sub></span>:</p>'),
('<p>典型的選槳問題：已知船速（換成進速 <span class="m">V<sub>A</sub></span>）、需要的推力 <span class="m">T</span> 和直徑 <span class="m">D</span>，求轉速和螺距。把 <span class="m">n</span> 消掉，</p>',
 '<p>A typical selection problem: given the ship speed (as speed of advance <span class="m">V<sub>A</sub></span>), the required thrust <span class="m">T</span> and the diameter <span class="m">D</span>, find the revolutions and pitch. Eliminating <span class="m">n</span>,</p>'),
('<p>右邊是已知的常數，所以設計點一定落在拋物線 <span class="m">K<sub>T</sub> = c J²</span> 上。每個 <span class="m">P/D</span> 和拋物線各有一個交點，挑效率最高的那個。</p>',
 '<p>The right-hand side is a known constant, so the design point must lie on the parabola <span class="m">K<sub>T</sub> = c J²</span>. Each <span class="m">P/D</span> crosses it once; pick the crossing with the highest efficiency.</p>'),
('<p class="note">迴歸式的適用範圍是 <span class="m">Z</span> = 2–7、<span class="m">A<sub>E</sub>/A<sub>0</sub></span> = 0.30–1.05、<span class="m">P/D</span> = 0.5–1.4，雷諾數 2×10⁶。預設值重現 MIT 2.611 講義的例題：B5-75、<span class="m">K<sub>T</sub>/J²</span> = 0.544，最佳 <span class="m">P/D</span> = 1.0、<span class="m">J</span> = 0.64、<span class="m">η<sub>0</sub></span> = 0.61。</p>',
 '<p class="note">The regression is valid for <span class="m">Z</span> = 2–7, <span class="m">A<sub>E</sub>/A<sub>0</sub></span> = 0.30–1.05, <span class="m">P/D</span> = 0.5–1.4 at Reynolds number 2×10⁶. The defaults reproduce the MIT 2.611 worked example: B5-75 with <span class="m">K<sub>T</sub>/J²</span> = 0.544 gives the best <span class="m">P/D</span> = 1.0 at <span class="m">J</span> = 0.64, <span class="m">η<sub>0</sub></span> = 0.61.</p>'),
('aria-label="葉數"><span class="lab">葉數 Z</span>', 'aria-label="Number of blades"><span class="lab">Blades Z</span>'),
('<span>展開面積比 A<sub>E</sub>/A<sub>0</sub></span>', '<span>Expanded area ratio A<sub>E</sub>/A<sub>0</sub></span>'),
('<span>標示的螺距比 P/D</span>', '<span>Highlighted pitch ratio P/D</span>'),
('<span>設計條件 K<sub>T</sub>/J²</span>', '<span>Design condition K<sub>T</sub>/J²</span>'),
('aria-label="B 系列敞水圖"', 'aria-label="B-series open-water chart"'),
('<figcaption>B 系列敞水圖。灰線是 <span class="m">P/D</span> = 0.6、0.8、1.0、1.2、1.4 的 <span class="m">K<sub>T</sub></span>（左到右）；紫色是標示的 <span class="m">P/D</span>，實線 <span class="m">K<sub>T</sub></span>、虛線 <span class="m">10K<sub>Q</sub></span>、粗線 <span class="m">η<sub>0</sub></span>。綠色拋物線是設計條件，點是各 <span class="m">P/D</span> 的交點。</figcaption>',
 '<figcaption>B-series open-water chart. Grey: <span class="m">K<sub>T</sub></span> for <span class="m">P/D</span> = 0.6, 0.8, 1.0, 1.2, 1.4 (left to right); purple: the highlighted <span class="m">P/D</span>, solid <span class="m">K<sub>T</sub></span>, dashed <span class="m">10K<sub>Q</sub></span>, thick <span class="m">η<sub>0</sub></span>. The green parabola is the design condition and the dots are its crossings with each <span class="m">P/D</span>.</figcaption>'),
('aria-label="交點效率與螺距比"', 'aria-label="Efficiency at the crossing against pitch ratio"'),
('<figcaption>每個 <span class="m">P/D</span> 在設計拋物線上的效率。最高點就是這個葉數、面積比下的最佳螺距。</figcaption>',
 '<figcaption>Efficiency on the design parabola for each <span class="m">P/D</span>. The peak is the best pitch for this blade number and area ratio.</figcaption>'),
('aria-label="葉數與面積比的影響"', 'aria-label="Effect of blade number and area ratio"'),
('<figcaption>同一個設計條件下，各葉數的最佳效率隨面積比的變化，線段只畫在試驗過的面積比範圍內。葉數少、面積比小的槳效率較高，但葉面負載大、容易空蝕，所以通常只用剛好夠的面積比（第四篇）。</figcaption>',
 '<figcaption>Best efficiency against area ratio for each blade number under the same design condition, drawn only over the area ratios actually tested. Fewer blades and smaller area give higher efficiency, but the blade loading is higher and cavitation comes sooner, so the usual choice is just enough area (Part 4).</figcaption>'),
('`最佳 ${', '`best ${'),
('<span class="m">P/D</span> = ${f2(pdS)}：設計點 <strong>J = ${f3(dS.J)}</strong>，<strong>K<sub>T</sub> = ${f3(KTb(dS.J, pdS, ear, z))}</strong>，<strong>η<sub>0</sub> = ${f3(dS.eta)}</strong></div>',
 '<span class="m">P/D</span> = ${f2(pdS)}: design point <strong>J = ${f3(dS.J)}</strong>, <strong>K<sub>T</sub> = ${f3(KTb(dS.J, pdS, ear, z))}</strong>, <strong>η<sub>0</sub> = ${f3(dS.eta)}</strong></div>'),
('`<div>B${z}-${Math.round(ear*100)}，', '`<div>B${z}-${Math.round(ear*100)}, '),
('<div>最佳螺距 <strong>P/D = ${f2(best.pd)}</strong>，<strong>J = ${f3(best.J)}</strong>，<strong>η<sub>0</sub> = ${f3(best.eta)}</strong></div>',
 '<div>Best pitch <strong>P/D = ${f2(best.pd)}</strong>, <strong>J = ${f3(best.J)}</strong>, <strong>η<sub>0</sub> = ${f3(best.eta)}</strong></div>'),
('<div>轉速由 <span class="m">n = V<sub>A</sub>/(J D)</span> 求得。</div>', '<div>The revolutions follow from <span class="m">n = V<sub>A</sub>/(J D)</span>.</div>'),
('`<div style="color:var(--pos)">注意：${z} 葉的 B 系列只試驗到 A<sub>E</sub>/A<sub>0</sub> = ${BRANGE[z][0].toFixed(2)}–${BRANGE[z][1].toFixed(2)}，目前是外插。</div>`',
 '`<div style="color:var(--pos)">Note: the ${z}-bladed B-series was only tested for A<sub>E</sub>/A<sub>0</sub> = ${BRANGE[z][0].toFixed(2)}–${BRANGE[z][1].toFixed(2)}; this is an extrapolation.</div>`'),

# footer
('<p>計算方法與 prop_momentum.py 相同：致動盤用一維動量理論；B 系列用 Oosterveld &amp; van Oossanen 的 39＋47 項迴歸式（雷諾數 2×10⁶），重現 MIT 2.611 講義的兩個例題；葉素–動量理論用 40 個半徑元素、Prandtl 葉尖修正，DTMB 4119 幾何沿用第一篇的內插。設計點 <span class="m">J</span> = 0.833 算得 <span class="m">K<sub>T</sub></span> = 0.215、<span class="m">10K<sub>Q</sub></span> = 0.406、<span class="m">η<sub>0</sub></span> = 0.700（試驗 0.146、0.280、0.69）。</p>',
 '<p>The calculations match prop_momentum.py: one-dimensional momentum theory for the actuator disc; the 39 + 47-term Oosterveld &amp; van Oossanen polynomials for the B-series (Reynolds number 2×10⁶), reproducing both worked examples in the MIT 2.611 notes; blade-element momentum theory with 40 radial elements and the Prandtl tip factor, on the DTMB 4119 geometry interpolated as in Part 1. At the design point <span class="m">J</span> = 0.833 it gives <span class="m">K<sub>T</sub></span> = 0.215, <span class="m">10K<sub>Q</sub></span> = 0.406, <span class="m">η<sub>0</sub></span> = 0.700 (tests: 0.146, 0.280, 0.69).</p>'),
('<p>資料與公式來源：</p>', '<p>Sources for data and formulas:</p>'),
